<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 教学协同 Agent</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>一个 Agent，三种角色视角</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={340} viewBox='0 0 700 340'><circle cx='350' cy='170' r='70' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='350' y='162' font-size='17' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>教学协同 Agent</text><text x='350' y='190' font-size='13' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>同一套业务逻辑</text><rect x='20' y='30' width='250' height='60' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='145' y='68' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学生个人助教</text><rect x='430' y='30' width='250' height='60' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='555' y='68' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>教师教学助理</text><rect x='225' y='250' width='250' height='60' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='350' y='288' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学校教研助理</text><line x1='270' y1='90' x2='305' y2='128' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='430' y1='90' x2='395' y2='128' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='350' y1='240' x2='350' y2='250' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='20' y='110' width='250' height='44' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='145' y='138' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>按已认证身份切换</text><rect x='430' y='110' width='250' height='44' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='555' y='138' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>独立对话与权限上下文</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>设计要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>推荐首先实现同一套业务逻辑、按已认证身份进入不同角色视角，使用独立的对话与权限上下文。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>暂不要求每个角色由不同模型或多个自治 Agent 承担。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>项目已有 backend/agent.py 全局教练与内部工具层，可作为查询、解题、教学和规划的实现基础。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>边界：不能将现有全局教练直接等同于已经完成三端协同 Agent——还缺长期状态、角色沟通与教师 / 学校流程。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>身份原则：角色来自服务器身份与职责授权，不从用户一句“我是老师”推断。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教学协同Agent设计.md §1–§2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 77 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>